WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:07.500
<i>This is the untold story of Son Goku's father, Bardock.</i>

00:07.500 --> 00:11.050
<i>It happened just after Goku was born.</i>

00:12.590 --> 00:17.300
<i>Bardock was facing his greatest enemy all by himself.</i>

00:18.850 --> 00:22.270
Why are you attacking us, Freeza?!

00:22.270 --> 00:27.900
We Saiyans were working as per your orders, but you still...

00:29.940 --> 00:31.690
He doesn't know his place.

00:31.690 --> 00:35.070
We were just using you Saiyans!

00:35.990 --> 00:40.160
And I thought it would be best to get rid of you lot...

00:40.160 --> 00:42.910
along with Planet Vegeta.

00:44.160 --> 00:46.460
Y-You bastards!

00:48.420 --> 00:54.260
Plus, it's going to save me the trouble of dealing with the legendary Super Saiyan.

00:54.260 --> 00:56.340
I'll make you pay!

00:58.220 --> 01:01.970
Thus, I will now fire off my lovely fireworks.

01:05.640 --> 01:06.190
What?

01:10.730 --> 01:15.360
Dammit!

01:43.140 --> 01:43.720
Damn...

01:43.720 --> 01:45.020
Freeza!

01:53.270 --> 01:58.990
I-I know I was there when Planet Vegeta got blown up.

02:02.120 --> 02:03.620
Where am I?

02:04.540 --> 02:10.040
<i>The landscape and sky here....
They remind me of Planet Vegeta.
</i>

02:10.040 --> 02:13.090
Oh, it appears you're awake.

02:19.430 --> 02:23.680
<i>Who are they? I haven't seen their kind before.</i>

02:24.470 --> 02:26.970
You can relax, we won't hurt you.

02:26.970 --> 02:30.980
My name is Ipana. I am the doctor of this village.

02:31.980 --> 02:35.860
And this is my son, Berry.

02:36.320 --> 02:40.320
He was the one who found you
collapsed at the edge of the woods.

02:40.320 --> 02:44.080
This is a secret ointment we use here on Planet Plant.

02:44.080 --> 02:46.370
<i>"Planet Plant"?</i>

02:46.370 --> 02:49.000
<i>Isn't that what Planet Vegeta used to be called?</i>

02:49.000 --> 02:52.080
This should heal your wounds.

02:57.710 --> 02:59.760
<i>My pain is subsiding.</i>

03:00.510 --> 03:03.640
<i>This stuff's just like what's in our medical machines.</i>

03:03.640 --> 03:06.140
What's going on?

03:06.140 --> 03:08.470
Have I ended up in the past?

03:10.980 --> 03:12.810
What's your name, Mister?

03:14.610 --> 03:16.730
I hate kids.

03:24.990 --> 03:26.870
D-Don't tell me that's...

03:32.170 --> 03:34.540
It's heading to the village!

03:44.590 --> 03:46.300
Listen up!

03:46.300 --> 03:51.680
From this day forward, Planet Plant belongs to our honored leader, the space pirate Lord Chilled!

03:51.680 --> 03:54.520
Those who go against us are in for a painful death!

03:55.520 --> 03:57.060
Hey, fellas!

03:58.820 --> 04:01.900
Who are you? Are you challenging us?

04:02.990 --> 04:04.410
Boy, are you stupid!

04:04.410 --> 04:06.990
Cavira! Teach him a lesson.

04:06.990 --> 04:08.510
Oh, I will!

04:22.590 --> 04:23.880
Dammit!

04:36.940 --> 04:39.440
This won't help my recovery.

04:42.940 --> 04:44.070
Thank you!

04:44.070 --> 04:46.320
You saved the village!

04:47.910 --> 04:49.870
Don't get the wrong idea.

04:49.870 --> 04:53.830
I don’t give a crap about you guys!

05:09.640 --> 05:12.810
I guess I'll stay here for now.

05:15.230 --> 05:17.400
Damn. How did I end up like this, anyway?

05:18.310 --> 05:22.940
I can't remember anything that happened after that explosion!

05:23.480 --> 05:24.780
<i>Dammit!</i>

05:24.780 --> 05:27.150
<i>What the hell happened to me?!</i>

05:29.160 --> 05:29.990
Who's there?

05:31.200 --> 05:33.790
U-Um, these are for you, Mister.

05:37.120 --> 05:39.920
It's food... and medicine.

05:39.920 --> 05:42.250
You can keep them.

05:42.250 --> 05:45.050
Now get lost.

05:45.050 --> 05:46.720
B-But...

05:46.720 --> 05:50.550
Shut up! Scram before I kill you!

05:51.640 --> 05:54.430
I-I'll put them here.

06:20.750 --> 06:22.290
Weird little brat.

07:03.330 --> 07:04.540
Bardock.

07:06.170 --> 07:07.670
That's my name.

07:09.380 --> 07:11.010
"Mr. Bardock"?

07:12.050 --> 07:13.340
Mr. Bardock?

07:13.340 --> 07:15.050
Mr. Bardock...

07:16.260 --> 07:18.020
Mr. Bardock.

07:18.020 --> 07:22.060
Mr. Bardock! Mr. Bardock!

07:25.980 --> 07:30.570
We've gone ten days without hearing from Tohbi and Cavira.

07:31.030 --> 07:37.950
L-Lord Chilled! I believe it's possible they've been attacked.

07:39.950 --> 07:44.420
Oh, so there is someone who would dare defy me?

07:50.090 --> 07:55.680
As much as I hesitate to do so, I think it's time I get my hands dirty.

07:56.390 --> 08:00.270
This pesky troublemaker will make a fine toy.

08:15.110 --> 08:16.950
It should be all right.

08:16.950 --> 08:19.120
That wound should heal soon.

08:19.120 --> 08:20.040
Thank you.

08:23.790 --> 08:26.920
Yes, this ointment is of great interest to me.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.040
And you are?

08:28.040 --> 08:32.670
We're the Space Police, the upholders of galactic peace.

08:32.670 --> 08:37.970
We've pursued two evildoers to this planet, do you know where they are?

08:37.970 --> 08:39.680
Two evildoers?

08:39.680 --> 08:42.730
Yes, we've been pursuing them all this time.

08:42.730 --> 08:45.770
Those two are no longer here.

08:45.770 --> 08:47.020
Bardock has already...

08:47.020 --> 08:48.770
"Bardock"?

08:48.770 --> 08:49.730
Yes.

08:49.730 --> 08:54.240
He used his incredible strength and brought down those two in a flash!

08:55.490 --> 08:57.450
Very well, then.

08:57.450 --> 09:00.450
We will have to give him our thanks.

09:01.830 --> 09:03.330
Where is he?

09:09.250 --> 09:11.380
All right, I'm all healed up.

09:11.380 --> 09:12.800
Mr. Bardock!

09:14.970 --> 09:16.010
What's with you?

09:18.340 --> 09:19.260
Well...

09:20.430 --> 09:22.970
More aliens came to our village!

09:23.600 --> 09:25.100
So what?

09:26.020 --> 09:29.310
I think they're looking for you!

09:29.310 --> 09:30.020
Me?

09:30.020 --> 09:35.110
And they looked really scary!
I have a bad feeling about-

09:35.110 --> 09:36.780
What the...?

09:40.120 --> 09:42.620
It must be them!

09:42.620 --> 09:46.000
Mr. Bardock, please! Please save the villagers!

09:46.000 --> 09:48.290
Please! Please!

09:48.290 --> 09:51.040
At this rate, everybody in the village will...

09:51.540 --> 09:55.630
Please, Mr. Bardock! Mr. Bardock!

09:55.630 --> 09:56.760
I don't give a-

10:00.550 --> 10:01.720
Mr. Bardock!

10:02.470 --> 10:05.520
Please save my father, the village doctor!

10:05.520 --> 10:07.600
Please! Please!

10:10.650 --> 10:11.690
Get off me!

10:15.070 --> 10:16.190
Mr. Bardock...

10:17.280 --> 10:19.360
Time's up.

10:19.360 --> 10:24.120
I'm done with the "Space Police" games.
Now it's time to massacre you all.

10:29.870 --> 10:31.290
You lied to us!

10:33.170 --> 10:38.510
I find it far more fun to torment people <i>after</i> I've put them at ease. Don't you?

10:39.510 --> 10:40.970
You devil!

10:40.970 --> 10:46.810
Oh, and I almost forgot; after I'm done, I'll be taking that ointment of yours.

10:46.810 --> 10:49.350
I-I won't let you do it!

10:49.350 --> 10:50.440
Really?

10:50.440 --> 10:52.860
Well, that's too bad.

10:55.400 --> 10:58.440
Those who defy Lord Chilled are fools indeed.

11:06.910 --> 11:08.000
B-Bardock!

11:08.000 --> 11:09.080
"Bardock"?

11:14.750 --> 11:17.500
Ah, so it was you...

11:17.500 --> 11:20.930
who defeated Tohbi and Cavira.

11:21.430 --> 11:23.140
<i>Freeza!</i>

11:25.800 --> 11:28.100
Freeza!

11:30.850 --> 11:33.900
You wretch!

11:40.820 --> 11:42.400
Bardock!

11:43.990 --> 11:46.160
Such power...

11:51.040 --> 11:52.710
You're just a maggot!

11:52.710 --> 11:57.590
Yet still you impudently oppose <i>the</i> Lord Chilled!

11:59.170 --> 12:02.260
Freeza!

12:02.260 --> 12:07.100
You keep calling me "Freeza." How utterly rude.

12:07.100 --> 12:09.390
Don't you know who I am?

12:10.560 --> 12:14.690
Why, I am the Lord Chilled, the greatest space pirate there ever was!

12:16.020 --> 12:18.400
"Ch-Chilled"...?

12:18.900 --> 12:21.900
<i>S-So he's not Freeza?</i>

12:23.400 --> 12:27.450
<i>I-If this is the past, then he's...</i>

12:27.870 --> 12:29.580
<i>He must be Freeza's...</i>

12:36.670 --> 12:38.290
Wh-What's happened?

12:39.960 --> 12:41.170
Stop this!

12:43.340 --> 12:44.300
Father!

12:45.180 --> 12:47.430
Father! Father!

12:47.430 --> 12:49.810
Dammit...

12:49.810 --> 12:51.890
How pitiable.

12:51.890 --> 12:56.640
Still, this has been a major letdown!

13:02.440 --> 13:05.780
I have no use for such a weakling.

13:09.950 --> 13:11.200
Stop!

13:14.040 --> 13:16.920
Mr. Bardock!

13:16.920 --> 13:19.500
Don't do it, kid!

13:19.500 --> 13:21.550
Don't get in my way, boy!

13:28.590 --> 13:30.050
Berry!

13:30.050 --> 13:31.600
Really...

13:31.600 --> 13:36.730
It seems like every little riffraff wants to butt in.

13:36.730 --> 13:39.020
Why you...

13:39.810 --> 13:42.320
Oh, so you can still stand?

13:42.320 --> 13:44.780
I'm... simply pathetic.

13:48.570 --> 13:50.490
If only...

13:51.200 --> 13:54.290
I had enough power...

13:59.670 --> 14:01.290
Back then...

14:04.090 --> 14:05.920
And back then...

14:26.530 --> 14:27.990
I...

14:29.490 --> 14:30.910
I...

14:33.280 --> 14:34.700
I'm going to...

14:38.710 --> 14:40.920
<i>destroy</i> you!

14:42.790 --> 14:45.710
You're going to "destroy" me? You fool!

15:39.140 --> 15:40.140
What the...?!

15:45.190 --> 15:49.360
<i>What's this? It's like I'm brimming with power!</i>

15:49.360 --> 15:51.860
What the...? He's changed!

15:52.700 --> 15:54.360
I will...

15:54.360 --> 15:56.580
make you pay!

16:12.260 --> 16:16.470
Don't get all cocky just because your hair turned gold.

16:29.230 --> 16:33.570
His hair turned gold, that's all.

16:33.570 --> 16:36.110
It was just a silly facade.

16:47.540 --> 16:49.420
Damn it!

16:51.590 --> 16:53.050
What happened?

16:53.050 --> 16:55.510
Wh-Who in blazes are you?!

16:57.930 --> 17:00.850
I'm... a mere Saiyan.

17:00.850 --> 17:03.060
A-A Saiyan?

17:03.060 --> 17:05.230
Say your prayers.

17:21.450 --> 17:22.740
Damn it!

17:22.740 --> 17:25.460
I won't accept this! I won't accept this at all!

17:25.460 --> 17:27.580
Damn it!

17:27.580 --> 17:31.040
I'm Lord Chilled, the space pirate!

17:31.500 --> 17:35.760
I can't have anyone be more powerful than me!

17:35.760 --> 17:39.430
Enough of your nonsense!

17:39.430 --> 17:44.850
You and this entire filthy planet will perish at my hand!

17:44.850 --> 17:48.480
You're the one who'll perish!

18:15.880 --> 18:17.970
Go to Hell!

18:19.340 --> 18:24.890
This can't be... happening to me!

18:50.460 --> 18:52.540
L-Lord Chilled, sir!

18:53.040 --> 18:56.340
T-Tell my family to...

18:57.420 --> 19:03.300
To beware of the Saiyans... who... who turn golden.

19:11.100 --> 19:14.900
<i>And so, Bardock defeated Chilled.</i>

19:14.900 --> 19:20.990
<i>Does this mark the beginning
of the legend of the Super Saiyan?</i>

19:23.030 --> 19:27.580
<i>It's not entirely certain, but...</i>

19:42.180 --> 19:46.180
THE END
